  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Jageshwar Rajak vs The State Of Jharkhand on 24 February, 2016",
    "facts": "The petitioner has been made accused in connection with Telaiya P.S case No. 182 of 2015 corresponding to G.R No.830 of 2015, for the offence under Sections 272 and 273 of the Indian Penal Code & 16 (B) of the Prevention of Food Adulteration Act. From the FIR, it appears that the children in a school became ill after consuming the eggs supplied in Mid-Day Meal. The petitioner is the President of the Village Education Committee and it is alleged that the quality of eggs was not checked before supplying to the children.",
